note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note omtrace: compile-phase and run tracing around omc, merged with a program's OTR1 events, written
note as Chrome trace JSON (Perfetto, chrome://tracing) and OTLP JSON. Handwritten seeded Omega; compose
note after native/trace/htrec.om (omtrace records its own phases with that recorder).
note
note   omtrace v FRAG                          validate an OTR1 file; exit 0 or 20+reason
note   omtrace c|r|f OMC PREFIX FRAG|- UNIT... c compile only, r compile and run, f also run the
note                                           program as PROGRAM FRAG and merge the OTR1 it writes
note Writes PREFIX.unit.om (the composed unit), PREFIX.bin, PREFIX.omc.err, PREFIX.trace.json and
note PREFIX.otlp.json. Exit 0 traced, 2 usage, 3 compile failed (trace still written), 4 output too
note large, 5 cannot write, 6 fragment unreadable, 20..31 fragment rejected (reason on stderr).
note A traced program's exit status 100+N means it hit trap N.
note No device is opened and no device clock is read; the trace says so in its own metadata.
note P holds every literal output piece, separated by ^ (byte 94), indexed by the consts below.
text P "{\"displayTimeUnit\":\"ns\",\"otherData\":{\"schema\":\"aien.unified-trace/1\",\"clock\":\"host CLOCK_MONOTONIC; ts and dur are microseconds from the first event\",\"device_timing\":\"NOT_RUN\"^{\"name\":\"^\",\"cat\":\"^\",\"ph\":\"X\",\"ts\":^,\"dur\":^,\"pid\":^,\"tid\":1,\"args\":{^}}^\",\"ph\":\"i\",\"s\":\"p\",\"ts\":^]}\n^{\"name\":\"process_name\",\"ph\":\"M\",\"pid\":^,\"tid\":0,\"args\":{\"name\":\"^\"}}^,^\"^\":^omtrace (host compile and run)^program (host runtime events)^device (NOT_RUN: no device clock recorded)^{\"resourceSpans\":[{\"resource\":{\"attributes\":[{\"key\":\"service.name\",\"value\":{\"stringValue\":\"omtrace\"}},{\"key\":\"aien.trace.schema\",\"value\":{\"stringValue\":\"aien.unified-trace/1\"}},{\"key\":\"aien.device_timing\",\"value\":{\"stringValue\":\"NOT_RUN\"}}^{\"traceId\":\"^\",\"spanId\":\"^\",\"parentSpanId\":\"^\",\"name\":\"^\",\"kind\":1,\"startTimeUnixNano\":\"^\",\"endTimeUnixNano\":\"^\",\"attributes\":[^{\"key\":\"^\",\"value\":{\"stringValue\":\"^\",\"value\":{\"intValue\":\"^\"}}^]^,\"status\":{\"code\":2,\"message\":\"nonzero status\"}^}^]}]}]}\n^aien.kind^aien.source^.^aien.^code.file.path^code.line.number^code.column.number^{\"name\":\"device.timing.NOT_RUN\",\"cat\":\"notice\",\"ph\":\"i\",\"s\":\"p\",\"ts\":0,\"pid\":0,\"tid\":1,\"args\":{}}^bytes^count^status^file^line^col^error^bytes_allocated^code_bytes^elements^stage^stage_name^slot^direction^a0^a1^code^trap_name^candidates^compile.phase^diag^gpu.open^kernel.launch^mem.alloc^mem.copy^host.wait^trap^user.span^user.mark^mem.moved^refused^build.upload^submit^host.wait^complete.check^overflow^divzero^range^loopbound^code5^stack^shift^code8^requires^ensures^code11^code12^code13^code14^omtrace^source.read^compose^omc.compile^diag.decode^program.run^omc.error^fragment.read^.unit.om^.bin^.omc.err^.trace.json^.otlp.json^OMTRACE_OK ^OMTRACE_REJECT ^OMTRACE_FRAGMENT_OK ^\n^usage: omtrace v FRAG | omtrace c|r|f OMC PREFIX FRAG|- UNIT...\n^OMTRACE_COMPILE_FAILED ^magic^version^recsize^clock^size^count^kind^form^time^name^nameref^opencount^0123456789abcdef^program^omc: line ^omc-diag 1 ^,\"dropped\":^,\"refused\":^,\"open_spans\":^},\"traceEvents\":[^]},\"scopeSpans\":[{\"scope\":{\"name\":\"aien.unified-trace\",\"version\":\"1\"},\"spans\":[^dropped^open_spans"
const PJHEAD ulong 0
const PJNAME ulong 1
const PJCAT ulong 2
const PJX ulong 3
const PJDUR ulong 4
const PJPID ulong 5
const PJTID ulong 6
const PJCLOSE2 ulong 7
const PJI ulong 8
const PJTAIL ulong 9
const PJMETA ulong 10
const PJMETA2 ulong 11
const PJMETA3 ulong 12
const PCOMMA ulong 13
const PQUOTE ulong 14
const PQCOLON ulong 15
const PSRC0 ulong 16
const PSRC1 ulong 17
const PSRC2 ulong 18
const POHEAD ulong 19
const POTRACE ulong 20
const POSPAN ulong 21
const POPARENT ulong 22
const PONAME ulong 23
const POSTART ulong 24
const POEND ulong 25
const POATTR ulong 26
const POKEY ulong 27
const POSTR ulong 28
const POINT ulong 29
const POVEND ulong 30
const PCLOSEB ulong 31
const POERR ulong 32
const PCLOSEC ulong 33
const POTAIL ulong 34
const PAKIND ulong 35
const PASRC ulong 36
const PDOT ulong 37
const PAPRE ulong 38
const PFILE ulong 39
const PLINE ulong 40
const PCOL ulong 41
const PDEVMARK ulong 42
const PLABEL ulong 43
const PKIND ulong 62
const PSTAGE ulong 73
const PTRAP ulong 78
const POWN ulong 92
const PSUFFIX ulong 100
const MOK ulong 105
const MREJ ulong 106
const MFOK ulong 107
const MNL ulong 108
const MUSAGE ulong 109
const MCOMPF ulong 110
const PREASON ulong 111
const PHEX ulong 123
const LBYTES ulong 43
const LCOUNT ulong 44
const LSTATUS ulong 45
const LFILE ulong 46
const LLINE ulong 47
const LCOL ulong 48
const LERROR ulong 49
const LBYTESAL ulong 50
const LCODEBYT ulong 51
const LELEMENT ulong 52
const LSTAGE ulong 53
const LSTAGENA ulong 54
const LSLOT ulong 55
const LDIRECTI ulong 56
const LA0 ulong 57
const LA1 ulong 58
const LCODE ulong 59
const LTRAPNAM ulong 60
const LCANDIDA ulong 61
const PSRCP ulong 124
const PEOMC ulong 125
const PEDIAG ulong 126
const PCDROP ulong 127
